$ apprafter argocd-password
[exit 1]
[stdout]
[stderr]
<ESC>[2m<TS><ESC>[0m <ESC>[32m INFO<ESC>[0m argocd-password invoked <ESC>[3mrefresh<ESC>[0m<ESC>[2m=<ESC>[0mfalse
Error: apprafter::secrets::age_key_missing

  × no age key at <SANDBOX>/home/.config/apprafter/age.key; the cached
  │ secrets cannot be decrypted
  help: Restore the age key file the cache was encrypted with, or set
        `APPRAFTER_AGE_KEY` to where it is. If the key is lost, `apprafter
        kubeconfig --refresh --target prod` fetches the kubeconfig from the
        node again over SSH and caches it under a new key. A new key cannot
        read anything cached under the lost one, so the command lists those
        secrets and asks before it creates the key.

